  ('P1','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','During a festival, people come together to ___.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Celebrate"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sleep alone"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fight"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Stay hungry"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "People come together to celebrate during a festival."}',0.3,'{P1,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','At Christmas and Sallah, many families like to ___ together.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Eat and celebrate"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cry all day"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Break plates"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Throw away food"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Families eat and celebrate together during Christmas and Sallah."}',0.3,'{P1,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','When your teacher asks, "What is your name?", what should you tell her?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The name of your school"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Your own name"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The name of your friend"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The name of your street"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "You answer with your own name so people know who you are."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','A boy is a child who is a ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "girl"}, {"id": "b", "text": "man"}, {"id": "c", "text": "male"}, {"id": "d", "text": "female"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "A boy is a male child."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','Amaka is 6 years old. What is her age?','[{"id": "a", "text": "6 years"}, {"id": "b", "text": "6 names"}, {"id": "c", "text": "6 schools"}, {"id": "d", "text": "6 houses"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Age tells how many years old a person is, so Amaka''s age is 6 years."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','A girl grows up to become a ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "boy"}, {"id": "b", "text": "woman"}, {"id": "c", "text": "man"}, {"id": "d", "text": "baby"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "A girl is a female child who grows up to become a woman."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','How many years old are you is called your ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "name"}, {"id": "b", "text": "size"}, {"id": "c", "text": "age"}, {"id": "d", "text": "colour"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "The number of years you have lived is your age."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','Who is the mother of a family?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The woman who gave birth to the children"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The teacher in school"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The driver of the bus"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The seller in the market"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The mother is the woman who gives birth to and cares for the children."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','The children born by the same parents are called ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "teachers"}, {"id": "b", "text": "neighbours"}, {"id": "c", "text": "brothers and sisters"}, {"id": "d", "text": "strangers"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Children of the same parents are brothers and sisters."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','Who is the head of a family in the home?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The father"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The baby"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The dog"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The visitor"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The father is usually the head of the family."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','What does a mother often do for her baby at home?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Feeds and cares for the baby"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sells the baby"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Leaves the baby alone all day"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sends the baby to work"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A mother feeds and takes care of her baby."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','Grandmother is the mother of your ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "friend"}, {"id": "b", "text": "father or mother"}, {"id": "c", "text": "teacher"}, {"id": "d", "text": "neighbour"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Your grandmother is the mother of your own father or mother."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','You find a pencil that is not yours in class. What is the honest thing to do?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Hide it in your bag"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Give it to the teacher or owner"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Break it into pieces"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Throw it away"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "An honest child returns things that are not theirs to the owner."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','Being honest means always telling the ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "lie"}, {"id": "b", "text": "story"}, {"id": "c", "text": "truth"}, {"id": "d", "text": "song"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Honesty means telling the truth."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','Which of these children is honest?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Tunde who tells the truth to his mother"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Ada who tells lies to her friends"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sani who takes another child''s food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Ola who cheats in a game"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Tunde is honest because he tells the truth."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','If you break a plate at home by mistake, an honest child will ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "blame the cat"}, {"id": "b", "text": "say sorry and tell the truth"}, {"id": "c", "text": "hide the pieces"}, {"id": "d", "text": "run away from home"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "An honest child tells the truth and says sorry."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','Telling a lie is a ____ thing to do.','[{"id": "a", "text": "good"}, {"id": "b", "text": "bad"}, {"id": "c", "text": "happy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "clean"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Telling a lie is a bad thing because it is not honest."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','Your friend has no crayon to colour. What is the kind thing to do?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Share your crayons with him"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hide all your crayons"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Laugh at him"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Take his book"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sharing your crayons is a kind and cooperative thing to do."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','When many pupils work together to clean the classroom, they are ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "fighting"}, {"id": "b", "text": "cooperating"}, {"id": "c", "text": "sleeping"}, {"id": "d", "text": "crying"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Working together to do a task is called cooperation."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','Sharing means ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "keeping everything for yourself"}, {"id": "b", "text": "giving some to others"}, {"id": "c", "text": "taking from others"}, {"id": "d", "text": "hiding things"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Sharing means giving part of what you have to others."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','Which action shows cooperation at home?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Helping your mother to sweep the room"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Refusing to help anyone"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Making the room dirty"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Shouting at your sister"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Helping your mother sweep shows cooperation at home."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','Children who play together nicely and take turns are being ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "unkind"}, {"id": "b", "text": "friendly"}, {"id": "c", "text": "greedy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "lazy"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Taking turns and playing nicely shows they are friendly."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','What are the colours of the Nigerian flag?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Red and blue"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Green and white"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Yellow and black"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Blue and white"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The Nigerian flag has green and white colours."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','How many parts (stripes) does the Nigerian flag have?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Two"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Three"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Four"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Five"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The Nigerian flag has three parts: green, white and green."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','The white colour in the middle of the Nigerian flag stands for ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "peace"}, {"id": "b", "text": "money"}, {"id": "c", "text": "food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "cars"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The white part of the flag stands for peace."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','The green colour on the Nigerian flag stands for our ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "farms and land"}, {"id": "b", "text": "toys"}, {"id": "c", "text": "shoes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "phones"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The green colour stands for Nigeria''s rich farmland."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','We should treat our national flag with ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "respect"}, {"id": "b", "text": "anger"}, {"id": "c", "text": "dirt"}, {"id": "d", "text": "food"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The national flag is a symbol of our country and must be respected."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','What do we sing to honour our country Nigeria?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The national anthem"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A birthday song"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A story"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A market song"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The national anthem is sung to honour our country."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','When the national anthem is being sung, we should ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "stand still and quiet"}, {"id": "b", "text": "run around"}, {"id": "c", "text": "eat food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "sleep"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We stand still and quiet to show respect during the national anthem."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','The words we say to promise to be faithful and loyal to Nigeria is called the ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "national pledge"}, {"id": "b", "text": "shopping list"}, {"id": "c", "text": "class rule"}, {"id": "d", "text": "story book"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The national pledge is our promise to be faithful and loyal to Nigeria."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','The national anthem and pledge belong to ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "one family"}, {"id": "b", "text": "the whole country Nigeria"}, {"id": "c", "text": "one school only"}, {"id": "d", "text": "one market"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The anthem and pledge are national symbols for the whole country."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','The national anthem begins with the words "Arise, O ____".','[{"id": "a", "text": "Children"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Compatriots"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Teachers"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Friends"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Nigeria''s national anthem begins with \"Arise, O Compatriots\"."}',0.35,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O1','Who helps us to stay well when we are sick?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A doctor or nurse"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A driver"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A farmer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A tailor"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Doctors and nurses help us to get well when we are sick."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O1','Who teaches pupils in the school?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The teacher"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The baker"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The pilot"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The barber"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A teacher teaches pupils in school."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O1','A person who grows food for us to eat is a ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "farmer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "doctor"}, {"id": "c", "text": "police officer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "teacher"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A farmer grows the food we eat."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O1','Who helps to keep us safe and catch bad people?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The police officer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The cook"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The singer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The painter"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The police officer keeps the community safe."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O1','A driver helps us to ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "travel from place to place"}, {"id": "b", "text": "cook our food"}, {"id": "c", "text": "sew our clothes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "cut our hair"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A driver helps us travel from one place to another."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O2','The people who live close to your house are your ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "neighbours"}, {"id": "b", "text": "teachers"}, {"id": "c", "text": "doctors"}, {"id": "d", "text": "strangers"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "People who live near your home are your neighbours."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O2','How should you greet an older neighbour in the morning?','[{"id": "a", "text": "\"Good morning, sir/ma\""}, {"id": "b", "text": "Ignore them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shout at them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Laugh at them"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Greeting elders politely, like \"Good morning, sir/ma\", shows good manners."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O2','Which of these is good behaviour towards a neighbour?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Helping them carry a heavy load"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Throwing dirt in their yard"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Making loud noise all night"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Stealing their fruit"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Helping a neighbour is good and kind behaviour."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
