  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T4','CIV-T4-O2','Living together in peace with our neighbours makes the community ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "happy and safe"}, {"id": "b", "text": "dirty"}, {"id": "c", "text": "sad"}, {"id": "d", "text": "afraid"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Living in peace makes the community happy and safe."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O1','Why do we have rules in the classroom?','[{"id": "a", "text": "To help us behave well and learn"}, {"id": "b", "text": "To make us cry"}, {"id": "c", "text": "To waste our time"}, {"id": "d", "text": "To make us hungry"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Rules help us behave well so everyone can learn."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O1','A child who does what his parents ask is being ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "obedient"}, {"id": "b", "text": "rude"}, {"id": "c", "text": "lazy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "greedy"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Doing what your parents ask means you are obedient."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O1','Which of these is a good rule at home?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Wash your hands before eating"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Never sleep at night"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Break the plates"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Shout at everyone"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Washing your hands before eating is a good home rule."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O1','In school, we should listen to our teacher because it is ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "the right thing to do"}, {"id": "b", "text": "a bad thing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "not important"}, {"id": "d", "text": "a game"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Listening to the teacher is the right thing to do."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O1','When we obey good rules, everyone stays ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "safe and happy"}, {"id": "b", "text": "angry"}, {"id": "c", "text": "sick"}, {"id": "d", "text": "hungry"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Obeying good rules keeps everyone safe and happy."}',0.3,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O2','Which of these is good behaviour?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Saying \"thank you\" when given a gift"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Snatching things from others"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fighting your friends"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Telling lies"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Saying \"thank you\" is polite and good behaviour."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O2','Which of these is bad behaviour?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Helping an old woman"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Bullying a small child"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Greeting your teacher"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sharing your food"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Bullying a small child is bad behaviour."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O2','What is the polite word to use when you want something?','[{"id": "a", "text": "\"Please\""}, {"id": "b", "text": "\"Give me now!\""}, {"id": "c", "text": "\"Go away!\""}, {"id": "d", "text": "\"No!\""}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We say \"please\" to be polite when asking for something."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O2','A good child who does something wrong will say ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "\"I am sorry\""}, {"id": "b", "text": "nothing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "\"It is not my fault\""}, {"id": "d", "text": "\"So what?\""}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Saying \"I am sorry\" is the right thing when you do something wrong."}',0.25,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','CIV','CIV-T5','CIV-T5-O2','Keeping your school compound clean is ____ behaviour.','[{"id": "a", "text": "good"}, {"id": "b", "text": "bad"}, {"id": "c", "text": "rude"}, {"id": "d", "text": "wrong"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Keeping the school clean is good behaviour."}',0.2,'{P1,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
