  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O2','How should you greet your teacher in the morning?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Good morning"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Go away"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Good night"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Keep quiet"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We greet ''Good morning'' in the morning."}',0.25,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O1','What do we say when someone gives us a gift?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Thank you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Go away"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Give me more"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Be quiet"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We say ''thank you'' when we receive a gift."}',0.2,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O1','What do we say when we make a mistake or step on someone?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sorry"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hello"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Well done"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Goodbye"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We say ''sorry'' when we make a mistake."}',0.25,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O1','In many Nigerian homes, what do children do to greet an elder with respect?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Kneel or bow"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Turn their back"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Laugh at them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Run away"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Children kneel or bow to greet elders with respect."}',0.3,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O1','What do we say when we want to pass by someone politely?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Excuse me"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Shut up"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Get lost"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Come here"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We say ''excuse me'' to pass by politely."}',0.3,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O1','How should you talk to your elders?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Politely and with respect"}, {"id": "b", "text": "By shouting at them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "By calling them names"}, {"id": "d", "text": "By ignoring them"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We speak to elders politely and with respect."}',0.3,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O2','Which of these is a Nigerian food?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Jollof rice"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A pencil"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A shoe"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A stone"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Jollof rice is a popular Nigerian food."}',0.2,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O2','Which of these do we wear on our body?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Clothes"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A table"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A pot"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A ball"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We wear clothes on our body."}',0.2,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O2','What do people often do during a celebration like a naming ceremony?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sing and dance"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cry all day"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fight one another"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleep the whole time"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "People sing and dance to celebrate happy times."}',0.3,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O2','Which of these is a Nigerian food made from beans?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Akara"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A cup"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A spoon"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A comb"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Akara is a Nigerian food made from beans."}',0.3,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P1','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O2','What do we wear on our feet to protect them?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Shoes"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A cap"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A plate"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A bag"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We wear shoes on our feet to protect them."}',0.25,'{P1,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
