  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','A song sung to praise God in church or worship is called a?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Praise song"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sad song"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Angry song"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleeping song"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A song used in worship to praise God is a praise song."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','When many people sing the same song together, we call the group a?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Choir"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Market"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Class"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Farm"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A group that sings together is called a choir."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','Which of these should we do when singing a song well?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sing the correct words"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Close our ears"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Talk with food in our mouth"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleep while standing"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Singing the correct words helps us sing well."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','Which instrument do you beat with a stick to make sound?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Drum"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cup"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pillow"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Book"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A drum is beaten with a stick to make sound."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','Which instrument do you blow to make music?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Flute"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Chair"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Spoon"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Slate"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A flute is blown to make music."}',0.25,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','Which instrument do you shake to make a rattling sound?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Maracas (shaker)"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Table"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Door"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Basket"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A shaker or maracas is shaken to make sound."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','The talking drum is a musical instrument from which country?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Nigeria"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The moon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The sea"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The sky"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The talking drum is a Nigerian musical instrument."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','Which of these is a musical instrument?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Guitar"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Pencil"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Bucket"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Pillow"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A guitar is a musical instrument."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O1','When you pretend to be another person in a play, this is called?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Acting"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Eating"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sleeping"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Counting"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Pretending to be another person in a play is acting."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O1','A person who acts in a play is called an?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Actor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Driver"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Farmer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Trader"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A person who acts in a play is an actor."}',0.25,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O1','In a school play, we can wear special clothes called?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Costumes"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Shoes only"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Books"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Plates"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Special clothes worn in a play are called costumes."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O1','People who come to watch a play are called the?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Audience"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cooks"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Players only"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Doctors"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The people watching a play are the audience."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O1','Which of these can we act out in a simple drama?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A story about a farmer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Nothing at all"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A bag of rice only"}, {"id": "d", "text": "An empty room"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We can act out a story such as one about a farmer."}',0.25,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O2','When we move our body to music, we are?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Dancing"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Writing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sleeping"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Reading"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Moving the body to music is dancing."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O2','A dance that belongs to a people''s culture is called a?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Traditional dance"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Toy dance"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Book dance"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Food dance"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A dance from a people''s culture is a traditional dance."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O2','Which part of the body do we mostly use to dance?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The whole body"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Only the ears"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Only the tongue"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Only the eyes"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We use the whole body to dance."}',0.25,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O2','What often plays while people dance at a party?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Music"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Silence"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A closed door"}, {"id": "d", "text": "An empty box"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Music usually plays while people dance."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T4','CCA-T4-O2','The Atilogwu is a lively traditional dance of which Nigerian people?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The Igbo"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The Chinese"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The Indians"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The Americans"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Atilogwu is a traditional Igbo dance in Nigeria."}',0.35,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O1','A cap worn by many Yoruba men is called a?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Fila"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Shoe"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Cup"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Bag"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The Fila is a traditional Yoruba cap."}',0.35,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O1','Which of these is a popular Nigerian food?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Jollof rice"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sand"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Paper"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Stone"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Jollof rice is a popular Nigerian food."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O1','Wrapper and blouse are traditional clothes worn by many Nigerian?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Women"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cars"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Goats"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Trees"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Wrapper and blouse are worn by many Nigerian women."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O1','Which of these is a Nigerian swallow food eaten with soup?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Eba"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Crayon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Chalk"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Nail"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Eba is a Nigerian swallow eaten with soup."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O1','Beads worn round the neck for beauty and culture are called?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Necklace beads"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Firewood"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Water"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sand"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Beads worn round the neck are necklace beads."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','What should you say when you are given a gift?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Thank you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Go away"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Keep quiet"}, {"id": "d", "text": "I am tired"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "It is good manners to say thank you for a gift."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','In many Nigerian homes, how do children greet elders in the morning?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Good morning"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Good night"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Goodbye forever"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Nothing"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Children greet elders ''Good morning'' in the morning."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','A time when people gather to celebrate their culture with food and dance is called a?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Festival"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Exam"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Punishment"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Quarrel"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A cultural celebration with food and dance is a festival."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','The New Yam Festival is a celebration about which food crop?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Yam"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sand"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Iron"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Paper"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The New Yam Festival celebrates the harvest of yam."}',0.3,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','Which of these is a good custom towards elders?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Respecting them"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Shouting at them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pushing them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Laughing at them"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Respecting elders is a good custom."}',0.2,'{P2,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','What does it mean to be honest?','[{"id": "a", "text": "To tell lies"}, {"id": "b", "text": "To always tell the truth"}, {"id": "c", "text": "To take what is not yours"}, {"id": "d", "text": "To cheat in games"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Being honest means always telling the truth."}',0.2,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','A child who does not tell lies is said to be what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Honest"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Lazy"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Late"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hungry"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A child who does not tell lies is honest."}',0.2,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','Which of these is an example of honesty?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Copying your friend''s work"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Saying you broke the cup when you did"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Blaming your brother for your mistake"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hiding a torn book"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Admitting that you broke the cup is telling the truth, which is honesty."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','Chidi found a pencil that is not his. The honest thing to do is to what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keep it for himself"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hide it in his bag"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Give it back to the owner"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Throw it away"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "An honest child returns what is not his to the owner."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','The opposite of telling the truth is what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Telling a lie"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Being kind"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sharing food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Saying thank you"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The opposite of telling the truth is telling a lie."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','When you are honest, people will do what to you?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Trust you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Fear you"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Beat you"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Ignore you"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Honest people are trusted by others."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','Why should you tell your teacher the truth?','[{"id": "a", "text": "So she will punish you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "So she can trust you"}, {"id": "c", "text": "So you can miss class"}, {"id": "d", "text": "So you can go home"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Telling the truth helps your teacher to trust you."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','A pupil who cheats in an exam is not being what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Honest"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Tall"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Clean"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fast"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Cheating in an exam is dishonest, not honest."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','Honest children make their parents feel what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sad"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Angry"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Happy and proud"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Afraid"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Parents feel happy and proud of honest children."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','It is good to be honest because honesty brings what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Trouble"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Trust and friendship"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sickness"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hunger"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Honesty brings trust and friendship between people."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','Cooperation means what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Working together with others"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Fighting with others"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Playing alone"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Shouting at friends"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Cooperation means working together with others."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','When pupils clean the classroom together, they are showing what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Anger"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Cooperation"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fear"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Greed"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Cleaning the classroom together is cooperation."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','People who cooperate like to do things how?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Alone"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Together"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Angrily"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Secretly"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "People who cooperate do things together."}',0.2,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','Which word means the same as cooperation?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Team work"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Fighting"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Crying"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleeping"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Cooperation is the same as team work."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O1','A child who refuses to work with others is not showing what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cooperation"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hunger"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sleep"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Colour"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Refusing to work with others is a lack of cooperation."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','How can you cooperate at home?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Help to sweep the floor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Refuse to eat"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Break the plates"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hide from your mother"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Helping to sweep the floor is a way of cooperating at home."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','During group work in class, you should do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Share ideas with your group"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Keep quiet and do nothing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Tear your friend''s book"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Run out of class"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sharing ideas with your group is cooperation during group work."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','When your friend is carrying heavy books, you should do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Laugh at her"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Help her carry them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Walk away"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Push her down"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Helping a friend carry heavy books shows cooperation."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','Playing a football game needs the whole team to do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cooperate"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Quarrel"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sleep"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Go home"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A football team must cooperate to play and win."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T2','CIV-T2-O2','When the whole family works together to tidy the house, the work becomes what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Harder"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Easier"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Longer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sadder"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Working together makes the work easier to finish."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','Who helps to teach pupils in the school?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The teacher"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The driver"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The farmer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The tailor"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The teacher helps to teach pupils in school."}',0.2,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','Who gives us medicine when we are sick?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The doctor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The barber"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The bricklayer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The trader"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The doctor treats us and gives medicine when we are sick."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','Who grows the food that we eat?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The farmer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The pilot"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The nurse"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The teacher"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The farmer grows food such as yam, rice and maize."}',0.2,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','Who keeps our streets and community safe?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The police"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The cook"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The tailor"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The carpenter"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The police keep our community safe."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O1','Who sews our clothes?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The tailor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The doctor"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The driver"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The farmer"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The tailor sews clothes for people."}',0.2,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','A good neighbour is one who does what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Helps others"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Fights everyone"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Steals from people"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Makes too much noise"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A good neighbour helps others in the community."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','When you meet an elder in your community, you should do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Greet the elder politely"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Run away"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shout at the elder"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Laugh at the elder"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We should greet our elders politely."}',0.25,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','How should you keep your community?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Clean and tidy"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Full of dirt"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Full of noise"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Dark and dirty"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We should keep our community clean and tidy."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','If your neighbour is sick, a kind thing to do is to what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Visit and help them"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Laugh at them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Ignore them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Make noise near them"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Visiting and helping a sick neighbour is good behaviour."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P2','CIV','CIV-T3','CIV-T3-O2','Which of these is bad behaviour in a community?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Fighting your neighbours"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Greeting people"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sharing with others"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Keeping clean"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Fighting your neighbours is bad behaviour in a community."}',0.3,'{P2,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
