  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O1','On which surface do we usually draw in class?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Paper"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Water"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sand in the air"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fire"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We draw on paper because it holds pencil and colour marks."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O1','What do we call the sharp tool used to sharpen a pencil?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sharpener"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Ruler"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Eraser"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Brush"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A sharpener makes the tip of a pencil pointed for drawing."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O2','Which of these is a primary colour?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Green"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Red"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Purple"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Orange"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Red is one of the three primary colours."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O2','The three primary colours are red, blue and ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Yellow"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Brown"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pink"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Grey"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The primary colours are red, blue and yellow."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O2','What colour do we usually use to colour the leaves of a tree?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Green"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Black"}, {"id": "c", "text": "White"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Blue"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Most leaves are green, so we colour them green."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O2','Which colour is the sky on a clear day?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Blue"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Red"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Brown"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Green"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The clear sky looks blue, so we colour it blue."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T1','CCA-T1-O2','What do we call sticks of colour used to colour pictures?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Crayons"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Nails"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pins"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Rulers"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Crayons are coloured sticks used to fill in pictures."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O1','Which soft material is best for moulding a small pot?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Clay"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Iron"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Glass"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Stone"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Clay is soft and easy to mould into shapes like pots."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O1','What do we use to join two pieces of paper together?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Gum or glue"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Water only"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sand"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Salt"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Gum or glue sticks pieces of paper together."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O1','Which tool is used to cut paper for craft work?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Scissors"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Spoon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Cup"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Plate"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Scissors are used to cut paper into shapes."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O1','From which plant part can we weave a local mat or basket?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Raffia or palm leaves"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Water"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fire"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Smoke"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Raffia and palm leaves are woven to make mats and baskets."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O1','Before we mould clay, what should we do to make it soft?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Add a little water"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Add sand"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Add salt"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Burn it"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A little water makes clay soft and easy to shape."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O2','When we fold paper to make a shape, what activity are we doing?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Paper folding (craft)"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Singing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Dancing"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Running"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Folding paper into shapes is a paper craft activity."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O2','What can you mould from clay?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A small ball or pot"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A moving car"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Real fire"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Rain"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Clay can be moulded into simple shapes like balls and pots."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O2','After making a clay pot, how do we make it hard and strong?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Dry it in the sun"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Pour water on it"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Add more gum"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cut it with scissors"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Drying clay in the sun makes it hard and strong."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O2','What should you do after finishing craft work with glue on your hands?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Wash your hands"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Eat with them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Rub your eyes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Leave them dirty"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We wash our hands to stay clean after craft work."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T2','CCA-T2-O2','A paper hat is an example of a craft made from ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Paper"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Iron"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Water"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Glass"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A paper hat is made by folding and cutting paper."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','Which instrument do you beat with your hands or a stick?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Drum"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Flute"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Whistle"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Bell"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A drum is beaten with the hands or a stick to make sound."}',0.2,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','Which instrument do you blow to make music?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Flute"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Drum"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shaker"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Gong"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A flute makes sound when you blow air into it."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','The ''sekere'' or shaker makes sound when you ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Shake it"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Blow it"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Read it"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Bury it"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A shaker (sekere) sounds when it is shaken."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','Which of these is a Nigerian talking drum?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Gangan (dundun)"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Piano"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Guitar"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Violin"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The gangan, or dundun, is a Nigerian talking drum."}',0.35,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O1','Which instrument is played by hitting a metal bell with a stick?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Agogo (metal gong)"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Flute"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shaker"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Drum skin"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The agogo is a metal gong struck with a stick."}',0.35,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','When we sing together as a group, we call it a ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Choir"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Team"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Class"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Market"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A group of people singing together is called a choir."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','Clapping in time to a song helps us keep the ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Rhythm (beat)"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Colour"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shape"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Smell"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Clapping in time helps us keep the beat or rhythm."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T3','CCA-T3-O2','Which of these is a Nigerian national song?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The National Anthem"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A market song"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A cooking song"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A football chant"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The National Anthem is Nigeria''s official national song."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
