  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','During a festival, people often come out to ____ together.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Dance and celebrate"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sleep all day"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Stay quiet alone"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Do nothing"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Festivals are times when people dance and celebrate together."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
