  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','Festivals help us to remember and keep our ____.','[{"id": "a", "text": "Culture and tradition"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Homework"}, {"id": "c", "text": "School bag"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Shoes"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Festivals help us keep our culture and traditions alive."}',0.3,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CCA','CCA-T5','CCA-T5-O2','Which item makes the most noise during a festival celebration?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Drums"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Pencil"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Paper"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Chalk"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Drums are beaten loudly to make music at festivals."}',0.25,'{P3,CCA,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','A person who always tells the truth is said to be:','[{"id": "a", "text": "lazy"}, {"id": "b", "text": "honest"}, {"id": "c", "text": "greedy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "rude"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Someone who tells the truth is honest."}',0.2,'{P3,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','Which of these shows kindness to others?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Helping a friend who has fallen"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Laughing at a crying child"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Taking someone''s food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Pushing people around"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Helping a friend in need is an act of kindness."}',0.2,'{P3,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','How do you show respect to your teacher?','[{"id": "a", "text": "By shouting at her"}, {"id": "b", "text": "By ignoring her"}, {"id": "c", "text": "By listening and greeting her politely"}, {"id": "d", "text": "By making noise in class"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Listening and greeting politely shows respect."}',0.25,'{P3,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','If you find money that is not yours, the honest thing to do is:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keep it secretly"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Give it to the owner or a teacher"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Buy sweets with it"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hide it in your bag"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Returning what is not yours shows honesty."}',0.3,'{P3,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O1','Saying ''thank you'' when someone helps you is a sign of:','[{"id": "a", "text": "good manners"}, {"id": "b", "text": "anger"}, {"id": "c", "text": "laziness"}, {"id": "d", "text": "pride"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Saying thank you shows good manners and appreciation."}',0.2,'{P3,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CIV','CIV-T1','CIV-T1-O2','Why is it good to be honest at school?','[{"id": "a", "text": "So people will not trust you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "So people will trust and like you"}, {"id": "c", "text": "So you can cheat easily"}, {"id": "d", "text": "So you can miss class"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Honesty makes people trust and like you."}',0.3,'{P3,CIV,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
