  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T1','CRS-T1-O2','What did God rest and do on the seventh day?','[{"id": "a", "text": "He rested"}, {"id": "b", "text": "He made more animals"}, {"id": "c", "text": "He made the sun"}, {"id": "d", "text": "He planted trees"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "God rested on the seventh day after finishing His work."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T1','CRS-T1-O2','A good way to care for God''s creation is to keep our environment what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Dirty"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Clean"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Noisy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Dark"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "We care for creation by keeping our environment clean."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T1','CRS-T1-O2','How should we treat animals that God created?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Beat them with sticks"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Be kind to them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Chase them away"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Starve them"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "We should be kind to animals because God created them."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T1','CRS-T1-O2','Which of these shows care for the trees and plants God made?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Cutting down every tree"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Burning the grass"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Watering plants in the garden"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Pulling out flowers"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Watering plants helps them grow and shows care for creation."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T1','CRS-T1-O2','Because God made everything good, we should always say what to God?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Thank you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Goodbye"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Nothing"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sorry"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "We thank God for the good things He created."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O1','Who was the mother of Jesus?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sarah"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Mary"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Ruth"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Esther"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Mary was the mother of Jesus."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O1','In which town was Jesus born?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Nazareth"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Jerusalem"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Bethlehem"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Egypt"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Jesus was born in the town of Bethlehem."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O1','After Jesus was born, where was He laid to sleep?','[{"id": "a", "text": "In a big bed"}, {"id": "b", "text": "In a manger"}, {"id": "c", "text": "On a boat"}, {"id": "d", "text": "In a basket on the river"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Baby Jesus was laid in a manger because there was no room in the inn."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O1','Who first heard the good news of Jesus'' birth from the angels?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The shepherds"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The soldiers"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The kings"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The teachers"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The angels told the shepherds the good news of Jesus'' birth."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O1','What guided the wise men to the place where Jesus was?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A river"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A star"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A map"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A bird"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "A bright star guided the wise men to Jesus."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O2','Who was the earthly father who cared for the boy Jesus?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Peter"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Joseph"}, {"id": "c", "text": "John"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Paul"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Joseph the carpenter cared for Jesus as an earthly father."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O2','As a young boy, Jesus went with His parents to the temple in which city?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Jerusalem"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Bethlehem"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Jericho"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cana"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Jesus went with His parents to the temple in Jerusalem."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O2','When Jesus was found in the temple, what was He doing with the teachers?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sleeping"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Playing games"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Listening and asking questions"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Selling goods"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Jesus was listening to the teachers and asking them questions."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O2','What was the job of Joseph, who cared for Jesus?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A carpenter"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A fisherman"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A farmer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A soldier"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Joseph was a carpenter who worked with wood."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T2','CRS-T2-O2','The boy Jesus obeyed His parents. This teaches children to do what to their parents?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Obey them"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Ignore them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shout at them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Run away from them"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Jesus obeyed His parents, teaching children to obey theirs too."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O1','God told Abraham to leave his home and go to a new land. What did Abraham do?','[{"id": "a", "text": "He refused"}, {"id": "b", "text": "He obeyed and went"}, {"id": "c", "text": "He hid in a cave"}, {"id": "d", "text": "He cried and stayed"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Abraham obeyed God and went to the land God showed him."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O1','What was the name of Abraham''s wife?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sarah"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Mary"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Rebecca"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hannah"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sarah was the wife of Abraham."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O1','God promised to make Abraham the father of a great what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "House"}, {"id": "b", "text": "River"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Nation"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Mountain"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "God promised Abraham he would become a great nation."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O1','What was the name of the son God gave to Abraham and Sarah?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Isaac"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Jacob"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Joseph"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Moses"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "God gave Abraham and Sarah a son named Isaac."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O1','Because Abraham trusted and obeyed God, we call him a man of great what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Money"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Faith"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Anger"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fear"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Abraham is known as a man of great faith in God."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O2','A child who obeys God will also obey his or her parents and what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Teachers"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Strangers only"}, {"id": "c", "text": "No one"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Enemies only"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Obedient children obey their parents and teachers."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O2','When your mother sends you on an errand, the obedient thing to do is to what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Refuse to go"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Go and do it well"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pretend not to hear"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Go and play instead"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "An obedient child goes and does the errand well."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O2','Which of these is a way to obey God in the classroom?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Fighting your friends"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Telling lies to the teacher"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Following the school rules"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Making noise in class"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Following the school rules is a way of showing obedience."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O2','God is pleased when children obey. Obeying elders shows that we have good what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Manners"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Toys"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Clothes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Shoes"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Obeying elders shows that a child has good manners."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T3','CRS-T3-O2','What should you say to an elder as a sign of respect and good manners?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Greet them politely"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Shout at them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Laugh at them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Turn your back"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Greeting elders politely shows respect and good manners."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O1','Jesus taught us to love our neighbours as we love who?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Ourselves"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Our money"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Our shoes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Our food"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Jesus taught us to love our neighbours as ourselves."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O1','In the story Jesus told, who stopped to help the wounded man on the road?','[{"id": "a", "text": "The priest"}, {"id": "b", "text": "The Good Samaritan"}, {"id": "c", "text": "The soldier"}, {"id": "d", "text": "The king"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The Good Samaritan stopped and helped the wounded man."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O1','Who is our neighbour, according to Jesus'' teaching?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Only people in our house"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Only rich people"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Anyone who needs our help"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Only our best friend"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Our neighbour is anyone who needs our help."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O1','God shows His love for us by giving us many good things. This means God is what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Loving"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Angry"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Far away"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleeping"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "God is loving and cares for us."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O1','Which words best describe someone who shows love to others?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Kind and caring"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Wicked and cruel"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Rude and selfish"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Proud and unkind"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A loving person is kind and caring toward others."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O2','You see a classmate fall down and cry. What is the kind thing to do?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Laugh at the classmate"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Help the classmate up"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Walk away quickly"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Push the classmate again"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Helping a fallen classmate up is a kind act."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O2','A kind way to help your mother at home is to do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Break the plates"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hide the broom"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Help sweep the room"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Scatter the clothes"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Helping to sweep the room is a kind way to help at home."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O2','If your friend has no food during break, showing love means you can do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Share your food with him"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Eat in front of him"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Hide your food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Tell him to go home"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sharing your food with a hungry friend shows love."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O2','Which of these is an act of kindness to an old person in your area?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Helping them cross the road"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Making fun of them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Refusing to greet them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Taking their things"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Helping an old person cross the road is an act of kindness."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T4','CRS-T4-O2','When someone helps you, the kind and polite reply is to say what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Thank you"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Go away"}, {"id": "c", "text": "It''s your duty"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Nothing at all"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Saying thank you is a kind and polite reply."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O1','A person who always tells the truth is said to be what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Honest"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Lazy"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Greedy"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Proud"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A person who tells the truth is honest."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O1','Telling a lie is the opposite of telling the what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Truth"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Story"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Song"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Prayer"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A lie is the opposite of the truth."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O1','God is pleased with a child who is honest and does not do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Steal"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Sing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Read"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Pray"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "An honest child does not steal, and this pleases God."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O1','One of God''s commandments says, ''You shall not'' do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sleep"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Steal"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Eat"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Walk"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "One of God''s commandments is, ''You shall not steal.''"}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O1','Which word describes a child who takes what does not belong to him?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A thief"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A helper"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A leader"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A friend"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A child who takes what is not his is called a thief."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O2','You find some money on the classroom floor. The honest thing to do is to what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keep it secretly"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Give it to the teacher"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Spend it quickly"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hide it in your bag"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Giving the found money to the teacher is the honest thing to do."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O2','If you break a plate at home by mistake, an honest child will do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Tell the truth about it"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Blame a younger sister"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Hide the pieces"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Say a cat did it"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "An honest child tells the truth about the broken plate."}',0.25,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O2','During a test, an honest pupil will do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Copy from a friend"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Do his own work"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Bring hidden answers"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Ask a friend for answers"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "An honest pupil does his own work during a test."}',0.3,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O2','You borrowed your friend''s pencil. Being honest means you should do what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keep it for yourself"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Return it to him"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Say you lost it"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Give it to another child"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Returning the borrowed pencil is the honest thing to do."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','CRS','CRS-T5','CRS-T5-O2','People trust an honest child because he or she always does what?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Tells the truth"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Tells lies"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Takes things"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hides mistakes"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "People trust an honest child because he always tells the truth."}',0.2,'{P3,CRS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','What should you use with water to wash your hands and kill germs?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Sand"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Soap"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Oil"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Salt"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Soap and water together remove dirt and germs from the hands."}',0.2,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','How many times each day should you brush your teeth to keep them clean?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Once a week"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Only when they hurt"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Twice a day"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Once a month"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Brushing twice a day, morning and night, keeps teeth healthy."}',0.25,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','Which of these do you use to cut your finger nails when they grow long?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Nail cutter"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Spoon"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Pencil"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Comb"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A nail cutter is used to trim long finger nails and keep them short and clean."}',0.25,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','When is the best time to wash your hands?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Before watching television"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Before eating food"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Before going to sleep only"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Before singing a song"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Washing hands before eating stops germs from entering the body with food."}',0.3,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','What do we use to comb and keep our hair neat?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A comb"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A cup"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A plate"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A shoe"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A comb is used to make the hair tidy and neat."}',0.2,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O2','Where should you throw a used sweet wrapper?','[{"id": "a", "text": "On the floor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "In the dustbin"}, {"id": "c", "text": "In the gutter"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Under the table"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Rubbish should be put in the dustbin to keep the place clean."}',0.2,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O2','Which tool is used to sweep the classroom floor?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A broom"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A ruler"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A book"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A ball"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A broom is used to sweep dust and dirt from the floor."}',0.2,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O2','Why should we keep our surroundings clean?','[{"id": "a", "text": "To make it dirty"}, {"id": "b", "text": "To attract flies"}, {"id": "c", "text": "To prevent sickness"}, {"id": "d", "text": "To bring rats"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "A clean environment keeps away germs and prevents sickness."}',0.3,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O2','What can gather and breed mosquitoes if left around the house?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Clean floor"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Dirty stagnant water"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A swept yard"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A closed dustbin"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Mosquitoes lay eggs in dirty stagnant water, so it should be poured away."}',0.35,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O2','Who should help to keep the classroom clean?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Only the teacher"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Only the head boy"}, {"id": "c", "text": "All the pupils"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Nobody"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "Every pupil should help keep the classroom neat and tidy."}',0.25,'{P3,PHE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
