  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T2','SOS-T2-O1','Which of these is a Nigerian traditional food made from cassava?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Garri"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Stone"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Chalk"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Grass"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Garri is made from cassava and is eaten widely in Nigeria."}',0.25,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T2','SOS-T2-O2','In many Nigerian cultures, greeting an elder shows:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Respect"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Rudeness"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Laziness"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Anger"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Greeting an elder is a way of showing respect."}',0.2,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T2','SOS-T2-O2','A good way to respect our culture is to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Laugh at our traditional dress"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Learn our language and customs"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Throw away our food"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Forget our people"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Learning our language and customs helps us respect our culture."}',0.3,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T2','SOS-T2-O2','When an elder is talking, a well-behaved child should:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Listen quietly"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Shout loudly"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Run away"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleep on the floor"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A well-behaved child listens quietly when an elder is talking."}',0.2,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T2','SOS-T2-O2','Celebrating festivals like the New Yam festival helps us to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keep our culture alive"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Forget our history"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Destroy our village"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Waste all our yam"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Festivals help keep our culture alive."}',0.3,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T2','SOS-T2-O2','Respecting our culture and elders helps to bring:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Peace and unity"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Fighting"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Sickness"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Hunger"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Respecting culture and elders brings peace and unity."}',0.3,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O1','Which person helps to keep the community safe from thieves?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Police officer"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Baker"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Barber"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Tailor"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A police officer helps keep the community safe."}',0.2,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O1','Where do sick people go to get treatment in the community?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Hospital"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Market"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Football field"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cinema"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sick people go to the hospital for treatment."}',0.2,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O1','A place where people buy and sell goods is called a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Market"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Church"}, {"id": "c", "text": "River"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Farm"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A market is a place where people buy and sell goods."}',0.2,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O1','Who teaches pupils in the school?','[{"id": "a", "text": "A driver"}, {"id": "b", "text": "A teacher"}, {"id": "c", "text": "A farmer"}, {"id": "d", "text": "A trader"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "A teacher teaches pupils in the school."}',0.15,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O1','A group of families living together in one place is called a:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Community"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Country"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Continent"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Planet"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A community is a group of families living together in one place."}',0.3,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O2','A good way to live peacefully with your neighbours is to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Help them when they need help"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Steal their things"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shout at them"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Fight them daily"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Helping neighbours helps us live peacefully with them."}',0.2,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O2','When you disagree with a friend, it is best to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Talk and settle it peacefully"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Beat the friend"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Break the friend''s things"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Tell lies about the friend"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Talking and settling matters peacefully is the best way."}',0.3,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O2','Sharing and caring for one another in the community brings:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Unity and love"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Quarrels"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fear"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Trouble"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Sharing and caring bring unity and love."}',0.25,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O2','Which of these shows good behaviour in the community?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Keeping the surroundings clean"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Throwing dirt everywhere"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Making loud noise at night"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Blocking the road"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Keeping the surroundings clean is good community behaviour."}',0.25,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T3','SOS-T3-O2','To live peacefully, members of a community should learn to:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Tolerate one another"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hate one another"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Cheat one another"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Avoid greeting anyone"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Tolerating one another helps people live peacefully."}',0.3,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P3','SOS','SOS-T4','SOS-T4-O1','We should brush our teeth at least:','[{"id": "a", "text": "Once in a week"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Two times a day"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Once in a year"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Never"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "We should brush our teeth at least twice a day."}',0.25,'{P3,SOS,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
