  ('P5','HEC','HEC-T5','HEC-T5-O1','The main responsibility of parents in the family is to','[{"id": "a", "text": "Care for and provide for the children"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Leave children on their own"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Stop children from going to school"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Sleep all day"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Parents provide food, shelter, care and education for their children."}',0.3,'{P5,HEC,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','HEC','HEC-T5','HEC-T5-O2','Things a family uses to meet its needs, such as money, time and materials, are called','[{"id": "a", "text": "Family resources"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Family visitors"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Family names"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Family games"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Resources are the things a family uses to satisfy its needs and wants."}',0.35,'{P5,HEC,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','HEC','HEC-T5','HEC-T5-O2','A plan showing how a family will spend its money is called a','[{"id": "a", "text": "Budget"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Story"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Song"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Timetable for games"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A budget is a plan for how income will be spent and saved."}',0.35,'{P5,HEC,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','HEC','HEC-T5','HEC-T5-O2','Keeping part of your money instead of spending all of it is called','[{"id": "a", "text": "Saving"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Wasting"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Borrowing"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Losing"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Saving means keeping some money now for future use."}',0.3,'{P5,HEC,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','HEC','HEC-T5','HEC-T5-O2','When shopping for the family, buying only what is needed helps to','[{"id": "a", "text": "Waste money"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Avoid wasting money"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Fill the house with rubbish"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Make the family poor"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Buying only what is needed prevents waste and saves money."}',0.3,'{P5,HEC,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','HEC','HEC-T5','HEC-T5-O2','Using a daily timetable to plan chores and study time is an example of managing','[{"id": "a", "text": "Time wisely"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Money only"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Clothes"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Food"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "A timetable helps a person use time well for different activities."}',0.35,'{P5,HEC,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','Which of the following is a track event in athletics?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Long jump"}, {"id": "b", "text": "100 metres race"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Shot put"}, {"id": "d", "text": "High jump"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "The 100 metres race is a running (track) event held on the running track."}',0.3,'{P5,PHE,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','A field event in athletics is one that involves mainly which of these?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Running along a marked lane"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Jumping or throwing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Swimming in a pool"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Cycling on a road"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Field events involve jumping or throwing rather than running on the track."}',0.35,'{P5,PHE,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','Which of these athletics events is classified as a throwing event?','[{"id": "a", "text": "Discus"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Hurdles"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Relay race"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Marathon"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "The discus is thrown for distance, so it is a throwing (field) event."}',0.35,'{P5,PHE,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','The relay race, in which team members pass a baton, is an example of a __________ event.','[{"id": "a", "text": "field"}, {"id": "b", "text": "throwing"}, {"id": "c", "text": "track"}, {"id": "d", "text": "jumping"}]','{"correct": ["c"], "explanation": "The relay is a running event on the track, making it a track event."}',0.3,'{P5,PHE,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
  ('P5','PHE','PHE-T1','PHE-T1-O1','Which pair below contains ONLY field events?','[{"id": "a", "text": "High jump and shot put"}, {"id": "b", "text": "200 metres and long jump"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Hurdles and relay"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Marathon and javelin"}]','{"correct": ["a"], "explanation": "Both high jump (jumping) and shot put (throwing) are field events."}',0.4,'{P5,PHE,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
