  ('P5','PHE','PHE-T3','PHE-T3-O2','Why is it important to cover food and store water properly at home?','[{"id": "a", "text": "To make the food look bigger"}, {"id": "b", "text": "To prevent flies and germs from contaminating them"}, {"id": "c", "text": "To keep the food warm all day"}, {"id": "d", "text": "To make the water taste salty"}]','{"correct": ["b"], "explanation": "Covering food and storing water safely keeps flies and germs from contaminating them."}',0.35,'{P5,PHE,CCE,nerdc-quiz-seed-v2}'),
